 "notes": "One profile for GTA III, Vice City and San Andreas DE. PC keys: Definitive Edition PC defaults (magicgameworld GTA III DE list: Shift sprint, Space jump, Ctrl stealth, Tab weapon/radio wheel, W/S drive, Space handbrake, Q/E look, H horn, R sub-mission, Z look behind). SA-only keys (T gang follow, Y/N answers, Ctrl nitro) are not in that list. Two layers: F switches on foot / vehicle, B fixes it. Bikes (pedal = Cross) and aircraft use other buttons.",
 "tips": {
  "es": "Este perfil es para el esquema de control Moderno del juego (Opciones → Controles → Esquema de control: Moderno, que es el que viene por defecto). Si usás el esquema Clásico, elegí «GTA Trilogy DE (esquema Clásico)» en Juego actual → Otro juego…",
  "en": "This profile is for the game's Modern control scheme (Options → Controls → Control scheme: Modern, the default). If you use the Classic scheme, pick \"GTA Trilogy DE (Classic scheme)\" under Current game → Other game…"
 },
